            "rows": 4,
            "default_value": "Our lawyers bring unique specialties and the capacity to excel to every client we represent and to every case we take. At Defense Lawyers, P.A., we have a reputation among our clients and our peers for committed service and highly effective litigation. Because of our success in the courtroom, we receive a lot of referrals from former clients, as well as other legal firms. We enjoy our work and are truly proud when we help our clients achieve the results they desire.",
